{"text":"Já ficou pronto? 3 vezes hoje. E aí você larga a chave 10 pra atender. Não é pressa, cara. Ele só não sabe o que tão fazendo com o Gol dele, sabe? No BoxMonitor, cada etapa vira status. Recebido. Diagnóstico. Orçamento. Foto da pastilha do Gol, ele aprova pelo celular. Chega por e-mail e notificação. Terminou? Marca pronto pra retirar. Cadastre sua oficina pelo link da bio. Ele para de ligar pra saber se ficou pronto.","voice":"YU8EsJtXFMyKMxYtheDk","settings":"{\"stability\":0.45,\"similarity_boost\":0.8,\"style\":0.3,\"use_speaker_boost\":true,\"speed\":1.05}","seconds":27.167,"charStarts":[0,0.128,0.197,0.255,0.29,0.372,0.43,0.476,0.499,0.557,0.604,0.685,0.731,0.766,0.824,0.871,0.906,1.022,1.219,1.335,1.358,1.44,1.498,1.567,1.602,1.66,1.683,1.753,1.834,1.974,2.043,2.125,2.241,2.287,2.357,2.415,2.461,2.496,2.554,2.624,2.659,2.775,2.821,2.879,2.902,2.961,3.007,3.03,3.053,3.1,3.146,3.216,3.332,3.379,3.448,3.529,3.622,3.82,4.052,4.145,4.203,4.226,4.296,4.435,4.505,4.586,4.632,4.714,4.807,4.899,4.946,5.085,5.155,5.201,5.236,5.283,5.317,5.399,5.468,5.538,5.608,5.642,5.689,5.735,5.759,5.782,5.828,5.944,5.991,6.084,6.118,6.235,6.327,6.385,6.409,6.455,6.502,6.56,6.606,6.641,6.711,6.745,6.803,6.873,7.036,7.094,7.256,7.419,7.512,7.57,7.593,7.616,7.651,7.709,7.755,7.814,7.848,7.895,7.941,8.034,8.104,8.185,8.231,8.266,8.301,8.336,8.382,8.429,8.475,8.499,8.522,8.557,8.615,8.684,8.707,8.766,8.8,8.94,8.986,9.033,9.056,9.091,9.149,9.311,9.369,9.509,9.555,9.671,9.729,9.787,9.822,9.857,9.938,10.054,10.136,10.194,10.24,10.31,10.379,10.495,10.553,10.6,10.635,10.716,10.832,10.902,10.925,10.948,10.983,11.099,11.215,11.285,11.331,11.378,11.424,11.517,11.564,11.598,11.633,11.726,11.819,11.935,12.028,12.121,12.237,12.295,12.457,12.492,12.562,12.62,12.736,12.794,12.91,12.98,13.096,13.131,13.224,13.293,13.34,13.398,13.491,13.584,13.7,13.735,13.758,13.804,13.851,13.967,13.99,14.071,14.153,14.222,14.28,14.396,14.466,14.547,14.582,14.675,14.791,14.826,14.965,15.058,15.174,15.232,15.26